Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.35,0:00:05.08,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,In the demon world lived evil beings \Nwho followed their evil intentions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:08.65,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,and were infatuated with destruction \Nand violence... known as demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:11.76,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,Then there was the one who\N desired to use violence and power to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:16.37,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,bring these demons under his \Ncommand... the Demon King Ahriman.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.37,0:00:20.79,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,That desire led him to try to bring all \Nof the demon world under his control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:26.04,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,And so, the invasion of\Nthe demon king's army began!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:34.18,Default,AKOMAN,0,0,0,,Obey... the demon king!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.03,0:00:38.05,Default,YAIRYA,0,0,0,,Obey the demon king!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.70,0:01:16.10,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,The demon king displayed his \Noverwhelmingly colossal power
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.10,0:01:19.01,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,as he laid waste to the demon world,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.01,0:01:23.80,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,which brought fear to both \Nthe human world and heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:28.03,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,It was only a matter of time before the \Ndemon world was brought under one rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.03,0:01:30.15,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,It was believed that this evil invasion
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.15,0:01:35.53,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,would soon spread to \Nthe other worlds as well, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:56.07,Default,WOLF KING,0,0,0,,Impossible! My elite guard was taken \Ndown by a single strike...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.45,0:02:00.38,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I am the demon king's right hand, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:04.47,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Demon of the north, surrender to our army.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:08.64,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You're the demon king's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.73,0:02:12.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.02,0:02:14.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:16.57,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why did you suddenly withdraw our forces
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.57,0:02:20.06,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and stop our plans for \Nworld domination, my lord?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.38,0:02:23.15,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,This is a grave matter, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.15,0:02:28.66,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,If we do not take care of this obstacle, \NI cannot even think about the invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:33.04,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,An obstacle so great that \Nyou've stopped your invasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:34.48,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.48,0:02:36.30,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.97,0:02:41.68,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux is... My daughter is just too kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.68,0:02:42.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.79,0:04:24.99,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Demon King's Daughter is Too Kind!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:24.99,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DEMON KING'S DAUGHTER IS TOO KIND!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.24,0:04:27.39,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux is too kind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.39,0:04:30.11,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Er, by Lady Doux, you of course mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.11,0:04:32.62,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,My daughter that you are very familiar with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:34.12,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.52,0:04:36.86,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It is true that Lady Doux \Nhas always been quite kind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.86,0:04:39.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,and gentle for a demon \Never since she was born...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:41.99,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That's only due to her\N still being quite young.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:44.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time until \Nshe awakens to her true ruthless nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.63,0:04:47.26,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That's what I believed, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.95,0:04:51.81,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But over the past six months \Nwhile you were gone on your campaign...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:56.02,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux's kindness has just gone too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.59,0:04:58.90,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,She healed a human slave's wounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.37,0:05:02.15,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,she helped some demon slaves carry things,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:05.03,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,and shared some of her snacks \Nwith some slave children!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:06.54,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:09.91,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:11.79,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ah, Doux!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:13.62,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Look, it's a Mr. Lizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:16.97,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I saved him from the river!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.04,0:05:20.59,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Ah, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.59,0:05:23.74,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,But don't get too close to the \Nriver on your own, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.74,0:05:24.85,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:28.05,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,As you can see, she'll save even a lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:30.30,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,L-Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:34.66,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah, Big Sister Jahi! Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:37.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, I just returned...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:40.77,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,My duties as a father come \Nbefore my duties as a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.18,0:05:45.19,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm so worried about Doux that I \Ncan't even think about our invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:47.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:48.63,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.97,0:05:55.08,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then I... shall train Lady Doux and \Nturn her into a ruthless, evil demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:56.33,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.61,0:05:57.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ruthless?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.07,0:05:58.99,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.38,0:06:02.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,I shall guide you into becoming a true demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:04.55,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,That means we can play together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:07.01,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,No, there will be no "playing" involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:11.01,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I know that she is in good hands with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:13.52,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,So, what exactly are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:14.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:20.15,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,First, I will have her torture some weakling \Nhumans and awaken her instincts as a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:25.40,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,To do so, we shall traverse the dense \Nforest that leads into the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.15,0:06:29.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,There are still many lawless, stray demons \Nwithin the forest that still us,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.94,0:06:32.49,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,so I shall have Lady Doux also defeat—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:34.44,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:40.41,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Be careful out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.41,0:06:43.17,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go play with Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:47.55,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:52.18,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm certain that Lady Doux can't shake her \Nkindness because the demon king spoils her so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:56.02,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But I will {\i0}not{\i1} be spoiling her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.02,0:06:57.61,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux! Prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.61,0:06:58.56,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.80,0:07:00.56,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux? Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.56,0:07:02.34,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Did a stray demon get to her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:04.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Come get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:06.07,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,She's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:11.09,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,"A FUN GAME OF HIDE-AND-SEEK"\NLYRICS: KANATA NAKAMURA\NCOMPOSITION AND ARRANGEMENT: RYOTA TESHIMA\NSONG: DOUX
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:24.56,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Playing hide-and-seek with \NBig Sister in the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:28.82,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Fun, fun hide-and-seek
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.23,0:07:33.36,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Are you ready? (Are you ready?)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:37.99,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Not just yet (Not just yet)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:46.79,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Come here, come here now, and let's play
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:08:00.64,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Playing even more \Nhide-and-seek with Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.89,0:08:05.02,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,The birdies and bunnies are \Nalso playing hide-and-seek
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:09.40,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Are you ready? (Are you ready?)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.03,0:08:14.03,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Not just yet (Not just yet)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:23.12,italicstop,SONG,0,0,0,,Everyone, come here and let's play
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:37.57,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Aw, you found me! Okay, Doux will be it next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.81,0:08:39.66,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We're {\i1}not{\i0} playing hide-and-seek!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Please listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:48.28,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Demons steal, oppress, and kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:50.57,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Those are the three principles we live by!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:52.97,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We have no time for these games.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:55.86,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Please understand that... Lady Doux?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:57.35,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Eat up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:08:59.93,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,What did I {\i1}just{\i0} tell you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:04.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They looked hungry \Nso I gave them some treats!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:08.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Children are just so unpredictable...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.94,0:09:11.57,Default,DEMON A,0,0,0,,Look at that weak-looking demon over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.94,0:09:15.95,Default,DEMON B,0,0,0,,You'll be my dinner tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.95,0:09:17.70,Default,DEMON A,0,0,0,,We're splitting the goods, partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.05,0:09:18.78,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.53,0:09:23.62,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You outlaws... who do you \Nthink you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.28,0:09:25.66,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,You're next...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:28.44,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Your head's all bald, mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:30.67,Default,DEMON B,0,0,0,,Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:36.44,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh? Where'd Mr. Demon go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:38.30,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I had it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:41.73,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,She didn't get like this \Nbecause she was spoiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.73,0:09:44.31,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,She was {\i0}born{\i1} too kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:47.18,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,And her softness rubs off \Non everyone around her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:49.81,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Even beasts or demons...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:55.57,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,She's too dangerous. Her powers will \Neventually destroy evil itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.80,0:09:58.32,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I must steel my resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.32,0:10:01.83,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah! I found Mr. Demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.83,0:10:04.02,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We are {\i1}not{\i0} playing hide-and-seek!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:09.41,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We will now perform one of the \Nthree principles of being a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:10.58,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We will steal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.07,0:10:15.23,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,We will threaten the humans of \Nthis village and steal their food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.23,0:10:17.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,That is the trial I am giving to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.61,0:10:20.46,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Do you know what threaten means, my lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.46,0:10:21.41,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.41,0:10:22.81,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then, go forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:25.22,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay! Off I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:28.10,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,At this rate, not only will she not \Nbe able to succeed the demon king...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.43,0:10:31.37,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,she may not be able to live as a demon at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:34.27,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But she's the demon king's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.69,0:10:36.53,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,When it comes down to it, I'm sure she'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.53,0:10:39.22,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Hi, lady! Can I have a sweet potato, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.22,0:10:40.41,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Are you {\i0}shopping{\i1}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:42.22,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Sure, coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.37,0:10:47.61,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I told you to {\i0}steal{\i1} it! I thought \Nyou memorized your lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.39,0:10:54.04,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes! The cue card! We can \Nstill turn this around!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.27,0:10:57.54,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I... I am a great demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.54,0:11:01.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Y-You pitiful and foolish humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.34,0:11:05.80,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I-If you do not give me an offering,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:13.17,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I will rip apart your flesh, set your \Nbowels on fire, and send you into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.17,0:11:16.93,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,My, my. Are you pretending to \Nbe a demon in this day and age?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.93,0:11:19.66,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Look at those cute little \Nhorns you put on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.76,0:11:21.95,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.17,0:11:23.95,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.95,0:11:27.20,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Oh, but I don't have any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:30.83,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,You're stealing it, aren't \Nyou? I don't need any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.83,0:11:34.78,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,I injured my legs really badly a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.86,0:11:40.40,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,The doctor said I wouldn't \Nbe able to stand ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.40,0:11:44.28,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,On top of that, the veggies this \Nyear just didn't turn out well
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.28,0:11:46.06,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,and I can't seem to get any customers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.06,0:11:48.86,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,so I was planning to close my shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.32,0:11:54.24,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,So if you'll have something like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:54.97,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.94,0:11:58.73,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Are you not feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:02.94,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.94,0:12:05.65,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Hey, were you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.65,0:12:10.03,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,I told you. I can't stand up... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.62,0:12:13.70,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,M-My legs move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.15,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,How did...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:17.37,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.37,0:12:20.51,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I'll come by to steal from\N you every day, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.83,0:12:23.38,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So make sure you stay healthy forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:29.39,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.90,0:12:34.83,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,I guess I'm going to have to prepare \Nsome offerings for you every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.22,0:12:39.80,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Um... c-carry on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.62,0:12:43.70,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I stole it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.92,0:12:46.11,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Why are you acting so smug?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:49.20,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Helping a human with magic is \Nmost unbecoming as a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.51,0:12:52.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,It would've been more effective if \Nyou threatened her and stole it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.22,0:12:54.15,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! But...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:57.67,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,I learned that you can get \Nthings by helping others, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.15,0:13:02.42,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux wants to be a demon who helps everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.70,0:13:05.68,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Th-That will never be allowed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.03,0:13:07.57,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,GUUUURGLE
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.38,0:13:13.68,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Halfsies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.04,0:13:22.29,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Doux! I've come to pick you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.29,0:13:26.42,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Ah, Papa! Halfsies!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.36,0:13:29.31,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Isn't it yummy, Papa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.31,0:13:32.71,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Anything you give me is delicious, my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.71,0:13:34.73,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.63,0:13:43.00,italics,NARRATOR,0,0,0,,"The Demon King's Daughter Helps Too Much!!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.14,0:13:43.00,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,THE DEMON KING'S DAUGHTER HELPS TOO MUCH!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:44.81,Default,FEMALE VILLAGER,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.85,0:13:50.49,Default,MALE VILLAGER,0,0,0,,Hey, are you coming to pick her up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.49,0:13:53.47,Default,FEMALE VILLAGER 2,0,0,0,,Tell her to come by my place next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:56.98,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.55,0:13:59.98,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Welcome, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.22,0:14:03.86,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you for looking \Nafter Lady Doux again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:07.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.67,0:14:09.60,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:13.49,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Little Doux said she wanted to make some \Ndolls, so we've been making them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.87,0:14:15.87,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux's making the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.58,0:14:21.24,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,You two have helped me so much, \Nbut this is about all I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.24,0:14:22.76,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Grammy is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.76,0:14:25.88,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux can't do this well on her own!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:29.13,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Well, then let's do our best together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.13,0:14:30.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:34.10,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.10,0:14:37.02,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You're helping some old\N human woman every day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.24,0:14:40.27,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! The grammy who gave me sweet potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:42.52,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Jahi, what is the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:44.89,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,You're even wearing a disguise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.89,0:14:47.26,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Fear not, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.26,0:14:49.91,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,This is merely a trial to \Nentrap that old woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:51.03,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:57.22,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,In order to eventually deceive, \Nbetray, and entrap that woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:15:01.67,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,we are merely {\i1}pretending{\i0} to help those \Npeople so we can gain their trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:06.55,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Thankfully, it appears that old woman \Ndoesn't realize that Lady Doux is a demon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.55,0:15:08.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,so it was child's play to lure her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.77,0:15:11.77,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I see. So that's what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:14.44,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Then I have just the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.82,0:15:17.65,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.17,0:15:19.94,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Is that... salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:22.25,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Take one lick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.25,0:15:23.91,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Y-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.27,0:15:26.40,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.44,0:15:30.25,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well? You can't move, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:32.66,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.66,0:15:34.63,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,That is Puppet Salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:37.37,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,If any living creature has a taste of that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.37,0:15:42.17,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,they will temporarily be forced to \Nfollow any command from another.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:45.42,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wh-Why did you use that on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:48.59,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,To help kindle Doux's desire for domination.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.17,0:15:55.14,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Now, Doux. Go ahead and give Jahi an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:56.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,An order?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.18,0:15:57.16,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:16:00.43,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,She'll do anything you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:02.63,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.63,0:16:08.19,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Yes. No matter how cruel \Nor horrifying it may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.82,0:16:15.20,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.93,0:16:18.20,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,ORDERS\NHOLD ME + PAT ME ON THE HEAD
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.45,0:16:20.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,The demon king truly is terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:22.43,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.43,0:16:24.08,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.37,0:16:26.05,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Now, Lady Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.05,0:16:28.59,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Please make this the last time you \Norder me to do something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:31.12,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,But the effects are truly remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.12,0:16:32.97,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,With this, she'll surely be able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:36.65,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Make sure you give that old\N woman a cruel order!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:41.98,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yup! Papa taught me a bunch of \Ncruel orders, so don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.53,0:16:41.98,top,SIGN,0,0,0,,ANOTHER CUE CARD
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.98,0:16:44.10,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then go, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:45.48,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:47.73,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,With how much that old woman trusts Lady Doux,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:53.24,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,she should have no issue putting \Nthat Puppet Salt in her mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:57.99,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Then we will betray her trust and \Nthrow her into the depths of despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:16:59.59,top,DOUX,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:00.24,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,And then this trial will be complete...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:04.00,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Wait, why are you helping her \Nwithout hesitation, Lady Doux?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.95,0:17:06.82,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,This just means I must properly guide her...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.82,0:17:08.49,Default,FEMALE VILLAGER,0,0,0,,Oh, Jahi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.49,0:17:09.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.09,0:17:11.65,Default,FEMALE VILLAGER,0,0,0,,Could you come give me a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:13.84,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.84,0:17:16.47,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,M-My body's moving on its own!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.72,0:17:18.79,Default,FEMALE VILLAGER,0,0,0,,You're a lifesaver!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.61,0:17:18.79,top,BOY,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.79,0:17:21.35,Default,GIRL,0,0,0,,This way, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:24.63,Default,FEMALE VILLAGER,0,0,0,,Sorry about this. We just \Ndidn't have enough people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.63,0:17:26.75,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,The effects haven't worn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.75,0:17:30.61,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,More importantly, this stuff makes \Nme follow human orders, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.61,0:17:33.36,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Are you sure it's not defective?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.77,0:17:35.61,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Can I put this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.61,0:17:37.97,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:40.42,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Why are you taking stuff out of the house?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:48.12,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,It's been decades since my house was built, \Nso the floors and walls are falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:50.78,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,I decided to have it remodeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.78,0:17:57.23,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,I'm going to be staying at a friend's place \Nin the meantime, so I'm taking my stuff out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.23,0:17:59.01,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So you're going away?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:05.64,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Don't you worry. My friend's house and \Nmy new home are both in this village.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.11,0:18:09.27,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,But I have one request for you, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:14.53,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Wow! So many plushies!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.88,0:18:16.97,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Did you make all of these, Grammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.97,0:18:18.03,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.34,0:18:22.20,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,And I want you to have all \Nof these little ones, Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.20,0:18:25.36,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Huh? You're not taking them with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.36,0:18:26.36,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.59,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,You don't want them anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:31.80,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:38.58,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,All this time, I've dusted them every day, \Nwashed them, and sewed them back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.00,0:18:44.06,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,So they're very, very important to me. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.70,0:19:26.99,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,The ones who played \Nwith them are gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.97,0:19:34.23,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,I'm sure these little ones would be happier \Nwith you than with an old woman like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:36.05,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.05,0:19:36.68,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:38.48,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:40.49,Default,FEMALE VILLAGER,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.65,0:19:44.57,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Is Lady Doux doing okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:47.08,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.62,0:19:52.21,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Th-The plushies moved?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:56.05,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.63,0:19:59.96,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,H-How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:01.38,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.38,0:20:04.59,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I thought Puppet Salt was only \Nsupposed to work on living things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.22,0:20:08.36,Default,OLD LADY,0,0,0,,You're the first one I made...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.36,0:20:09.69,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,See? I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.10,0:20:13.06,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,They're all saying they want \Nto stay with you, Grammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:16.11,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Doux would've taken really \Ngood care of them, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.11,0:20:21.11,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,but the plushies want to stay with \Nthe person who took care of them the most!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.33,0:20:22.61,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Could it be that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:27.59,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux's kindness awakened the souls \Nof these lifeless plushies?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.30,0:20:29.74,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,My little ones...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:34.50,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,So you keep them, Grammy!\N That's Doux's order!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:39.25,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Doux... Well, if it's an order, \NI guess I'll have to follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.62,0:20:43.94,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,I may be old, but I'd love \Nto keep you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:45.51,Default,OLD WOMAN,0,0,0,,Now and forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.14,0:20:53.94,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,So, Jahi. How did the trial go—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.17,0:20:56.52,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:20:59.27,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Papa! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.27,0:21:03.15,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,This is my puppet!\N  I made it with Grammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:06.66,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Oho, look how cute it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:10.34,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Well done! What a good girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.10,0:21:14.04,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Next, I'm gonna make one for you, Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:19.09,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I'm the luckiest papa in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.31,0:21:21.56,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I'm so powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:25.79,italics,JAHI,0,0,0,,I know. I'll go back out to the battlefield \Nand take the heads of some enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.79,0:21:27.39,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Big Sister Jahi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:30.51,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.51,0:21:32.45,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,That's yours, Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:34.18,Default,DOUX,0,0,0,,Now, we match!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.18,0:21:35.69,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Lady Doux...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.69,0:21:38.49,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,Looks like you two have grown quite close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:40.91,Default,AHRIMAN,0,0,0,,I am trusting you to continue \Nlooking after my precious Doux.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.91,0:21:43.09,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Huh? No, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.78,0:21:45.40,Default,JAHI,0,0,0,,Yes! I will be happy to!
